सुतास इन्दवः

-47). The Heaven of Indra is Svarga;
 its capital, Amarāvatī; his garden, Nandana; his elephant, Airāvata;
 his horse, Uccaiḥśravas; his bow, the rain-bow, and his sword, Paranja.].
